  "notes": [
    "Final cargo test --no-fail-fast: 961 passed, 0 failed, 2 ignored. make test: 1012 passed, 0 failed, 2 ignored. Counts include repeated executions across commands, not unique tests.",
    "make test preceded the final per-case genesis guard, independent-reserve assertion and counterexample exit-code correction. Focused regression tests and the final no-fail-fast suite cover those changes; fmt-check and lint also pass on the final source.",
    "The two ignores remain the pre-existing bundle export utility and STA performance benchmark. No missing fixture is skipped.",
    "All attempted commands are retained. Early failures were compile adaptations, captured legacy-loader dependency support, rollback fee-payer expectations and lint hygiene. Successful retries are separate records.",
    "The original seven coherence tests, six authority tests and 21 population/classification/selection tests retain their source semantics, with mappings in phase-t4-test-mapping.json. Fourteen new integration tests exercise actual final-state VM execution, failure and replay.",
    "All 1633 inventoried STA source files retain their hashes. Both raw additional population captures match recorded source sizes and hashes; they contain historical provider-origin fields and therefore remain ignored under the absolute no-URL rule.",
    "All added text and new files scanned: zero provider URLs, real machine paths or private-key blocks. No SBF binaries or build products staged.",
    "Live-provider checks intentionally not run. All capture checks use mocks; no transaction signing, cluster simulation, submission or deployment occurred.",
    "Hosted migration, dashboard browser and Postgres checks remain pending their implementation in T8/T9. Frontend, report and governance reference checks pass with exact pnpm 11.24.0.",
